Third-party content

This repository redistributes the SYOG2026 ODF schema under
Rules/SYOG26/xsd/ (odf2.xsd, odf2-structure.xsd, odf2-values.xsd). Those
files are published by the International Olympic Committee, are not the work
of this project's author, and carry two local corrections described in
Rules/SYOG26/PROVENANCE.md. They are redistributed under the IOC's own terms
and are not covered by the MIT grant above.

The rule files under Rules/SYOG26/rules/ and
Rules/SYOG26/Disciplines/*/rules/ are this project's own work, authored from
the IOC's Data Dictionaries. The Data Dictionaries and the Common Codes
workbook are not redistributed here at all; the application fetches them from
the IOC on demand.
